# GameNight Host — optional public API origin / edge proxy (NOT applied automatically)
#
# Today production Mini App talks to:
#   https://dantilor-telegram-card-game-3706.twc1.net
#
# Future custom origin (domain not purchased yet), e.g.:
#   https://api.gamenighthost.ru
#
# Frontend build (GitHub Actions / Timeweb Static):
#   VITE_API_URL=https://api.gamenighthost.ru
#   VITE_API_BASE=https://api.gamenighthost.ru
# Keep both identical. Never point them at untrusted mirrors.
#
# API container (Timeweb App):
#   PUBLIC_API_ORIGIN=https://api.gamenighthost.ru
#   TRUST_PROXY=1
#   CORS_ORIGIN=https://dantilor.github.io,<future-static-origin>
#   WEBAPP_URL=https://dantilor.github.io/telegram-card-game/
#   GNH_REQUEST_TIMING=1   # temporary VPN diagnosis only
#
# YooKassa webhook must remain on the process that owns payments
# (current Timeweb API). An edge reverse proxy may terminate TLS and
# forward /api/* + webhook path to the same origin; do not split POST
# payment creation across two backends.
#
# Edge proxy requirements:
# - Pass through Authorization / x-telegram-init-data unchanged
# - Do not log request bodies or initData
# - Preserve Host or set a fixed upstream Host expected by the app
# - Enable HTTP/2 or HTTP/3 to clients; keep-alive to upstream
# - Health check: GET /health (liveness only — does not prove DB)
